# SIMULATION ONLY: load after boat.parm,platform15.parm.
# Evidence: docs/validation/corner_hold_2026-11-25/README.md
# Low-speed navigation requests (m/s, m, m/s^2); physical forces are unchanged.
WP_SPEED 1.0
RTL_SPEED 0.8
WP_RADIUS 3.0
ATC_ACCEL_MAX 0.2
# Plan 5 m stopping distance at 1 m/s; this is not a measured stopping guarantee.
ATC_DECEL_MAX 0.1

# Local straight-run fit: ~0.97 m/s required ~8.6% controller throttle.
# Percent here is controller throttle, not motor RPM. High-speed profile is separate.
CRUISE_SPEED 1.0
CRUISE_THROTTLE 9
# Avoid extrapolating this local fit to an 11.1 m/s pilot speed request.
# This scales speed-controlled modes; raw MANUAL throttle is not speed-limited.
SPEED_MAX 1.0
# Speed P remains 0.2; I=0.02 gives P/I=10 s and trim is bounded to 5%.
# The local FF fit removes the old ~13% steady correction; avoid storing excess trim.
ATC_SPEED_I 0.02
ATC_SPEED_IMAX 0.05
# Retain active braking: coasting-only candidates failed current holding.
ATC_BRAKE 1

# Continuous LOITER correction; zero deadband does not lock the physical position.
# Keep forward/reverse recovery; bow-only recovery caused large circles.
LOIT_RADIUS 0.0
LOIT_SPEED_GAIN 0.3
LOIT_TYPE 0

# Existing yaw-rate feedforward and AUTO position/velocity gains.
ATC_STR_RAT_FF 0.3
PSC_POS_P 0.1
PSC_VEL_P 0.5
TURN_RADIUS 6
# Yaw request limits (deg/s, deg/s^2), not azimuth joint speed or body overrides.
# Physical helm angle/rate/torque and the 0.03g AUTO lateral limit remain in force.
ATC_STR_RAT_MAX 20
ATC_STR_ACC_MAX 10

# Simulated link-loss policy, verified by parameter readback and link-loss tests.
FS_GCS_ENABLE 1
FS_ACTION 2
FS_TIMEOUT 1.5
FS_THR_ENABLE 1
RC_OVERRIDE_TIME 3
FS_GCS_TIMEOUT 5

# Experimental angular direction hysteresis; independent image only.
LOIT_DIR_HYST 20
